content:
Pokud potřebujete JSON schématu, který odráží strukturu souboru fstab, včetně potřebných omezení a vzorů, to mohou být poskytnutím vám v tomto schéma. Zde je schéma:

```json
{
  "$id": "https://example.com/fstab",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["/", "mount_point", "file_system_type", "options", "dump", "pass"],
  "properties": {
    "/": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "device": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "mount_point": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "file_system_type": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "options": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "dump": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-1]$"
        },
        "pass": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-2]$"
        }
      },
      "required": ["device", "mount_point", "file_system_type", "options", "dump", "pass"]
    }
  },
  "patternProperties": {
    "^(/[^/]+)+$": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "device": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "mount_point": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "file_system_type": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "options": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "dump": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-1]$"
        },
        "pass": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-2]$"
        }
      },
      "required": ["device", "mount_point", "file_system_type", "options", "dump", "pass"]
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

Pokud potřebujete dodatní omezení nebo vzor, mohou být poskytnutím v tomto schéma v tomto schéma.

